	(text "LAYOUT: Hot loop: C(10 uF)/C(100 nF) directly across high-side drain and\n        low-side source (shunt GND end); keep this loop as small as possible.\nLAYOUT: PHASE, +VBUS_PROT and GND as pours on both layers with via arrays (5-10 A).\nLAYOUT: Kelvin: net ties at the shunt pads, SP/SN as a tight pair to the DRV8323.\nLAYOUT: Short gate loops: GH with SH, GL with SN/GND return, no layer changes.\nLAYOUT: MOSFET drain pad: thermal vias, copper on both layers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 147.32 0)
